  "scope": "Private native signed-close receipt captures the complete declaration, signer public key, exact accepting point, original session and optional embedded/separate phase, original/service/material scope and optional native v5 inputs. Real MLDSA signatures rechecked; receipt/group scope validated; creation requires the same native declaration event and exact extras policy, no historical backfill or row mutation/delete/retype. Material retained across active-to-archive and TTL. Node supplies the actual raw CourtParams/ladder/prompt/held/offence/fork heights/family activation inputs. Prompt encoding uses an exhaustive two-form match. No end-archive schema or old tag meaning changed.",
  "test_scope": "One new runtime test loops over known-rules and explicitly missing-rules modes, both sides, with real generated MLDSA87 keys/signatures and actual declaration acceptance/chunk-count helpers plus native fold. Tests invalid signature rollback, original object/key/context preservation, immutable delete/mutation refusal, authentic-old-signature backfill refusal, codec key21/row27, heap/wire, malformed completed-side native end, archive retention and whole-parent undo/replay/carriage. No v5 proof verdict or archive settlement is executed by this new test.",
  "limits": "Original/service/capital and original custody signature remain fixture assumptions; no funded native original/public ingress/node v5 or actual supply test. Snapshot verification rechecks stored declaration signatures; native rules are rooted historical inputs, not additional signer consent. Missing rules are None and never replaced by defaults. Old groups without a receipt are not backfilled. Full maximum embedded/separate phase/family coverage and E01-E10/T01-T15 are not passed.",
  "extra_costs": "Declaration signature rechecks, message buffers, object/key/session/phase copies, serialization/root/journal/snapshot/reorg and byte-DAA retention are added uncalibrated costs for the full reserved original graph. New clone branch quotes before copying, but this is not full physical capacity or all profile cost coverage.",
  "schema_scope": "Candidate appended key21/row27 version1. Existing archive20/26, X3 and service IDs, tag230 retained. Optional native context is extras-only, outside preset/ruleset Borsh identity. No cap/price/horizon/model-tier/preset change, no arming/pre merge/push/deployment or public schema adoption.",
